From 6ccb7ee0adb67ea7604bdef30db467ce7d3d1239 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zebang Li <99422132+Mark101001@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:45:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(oauth2): Enforce token exchange conformance

Validate shared RFC 8693 parameters for native and on-behalf-of
exchange. Add the Keystone-native subject identifier and a marked JWT
extension point for future external mapping. Validate requested output
types.

Reject unsupported actor and resource parameters, preserve audience
narrowing, validate API scope, and include issued_token_type only on
exchange responses. Keep validation after rate limiting.

Use invalid_request for invalid subjects per RFC 8693 section 2.2.2.
Distinguish provider failures from credential errors. Cover request and
response behavior in handler and live-API tests and document the rules.

Signed-off-by: Zebang Li <99422132+Mark101001@users.noreply.github.com>
